# Vercel upload excludes for the zuiio monorepo.
# Local `vercel deploy` uploads from the git root and caps at 15000 files / chokes
# on huge files. agent-gateway only needs:
#   - apps/agent-gateway            (the app itself)
#   - packages/*                    (its @zuiio/* workspace deps)
#   - root config (package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml)
# Sibling apps (zer, tolom, onoo, website, tamga, ...) are NOT dependencies of
# agent-gateway, so we exclude them from the upload to stay under the 15000-file
# cap. Vercel reinstalls dependencies during the build, so node_modules is excluded.

# Dependencies (reinstalled by Vercel during build)
**/node_modules/
# Sibling applications (not part of agent-gateway's build graph)
apps/tamga/
apps/zuiio-id/
apps/website/
apps/zraf-web/
apps/tumurch/
apps/zunch/
apps/zill/
apps/zatly/
apps/zraf/
apps/card/
apps/zim/
apps/side/
apps/zerbu/
apps/sms-pay/
apps/zoa/
apps/zer-app/
apps/tumurch-rn/
apps/tolom-mobile/
apps/tamga-web/
apps/sakhuu/
apps/onoo-app/

# Flutter / build caches that may slip through
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/CompilationCache.noindex/
.turbo/
**/test-results/
